# benches/

Criterion benchmarks for the `udex-server` workspace, isolating query execution and connection-pool performance independent of gRPC and authentication overhead. Benchmarks measure datastore baseline performance and can be compared against server-layer benchmarks to quantify framework overhead.

## Files

- `postgres_datastore.rs` -- Criterion benchmarks for `PostgresDatastore` direct DB operations with configurable seed datasets and batch sizes
